    ["RankSeasonConfig/0/gameDes"] = "#fea14fS0 SeasonTime: #fefefe2024/12/11-2025/1/22\n#fea14fParticipation method: #fefefeDuring the competition time, winning matches can earn rank scores, while losing matches will deduct rank scores.\n#fea14fStage introduction:#fefefe\nBronze: V，IV，III，II，I\nSilver: V，IV，III，II，I\nGold: V，IV，III，II，I\nPlatinum: V，IV，III，II，I\nDiamonds: V，IV，III，II，I\nChallenger\n#fea14fPromotion rules:#fefefe\nEvery 100 points earned can lead to an increase of one rank (Silver V - Silver IV)\nFor every 5 small level upgrades, you can upgrade to a large level (Silver - Gold)\n#fed039The large level will not drop.\n#fea14fAdditional rules:#fefefe\nLast season, Challenger will start with Gold, while the Diamond Division will start with Silver.\nThe greater the difference in rank, the less points will be deducted when failing.\nThe reward for winning increases and the penalty for failure decreases when matched individually.",
